{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AvatarAssetResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /assets/{avatarId}`（issue #38，v2.1 §7.4）。",
        "properties": {
          "avatar_id": {
            "title": "Avatar Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "bundle_url": {
            "title": "Bundle Url",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "version": {
            "title": "Version",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "avatar_id",
          "bundle_url",
          "version"
        ],
        "title": "AvatarAssetResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DailyEventResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /spirits/{placeId}/daily-event`（issue #26）。\n\n公開世界狀態，不需要任何 token。永遠回傳 `200` 加內容——今天沒快取回\n昨天的，連昨天都沒有回人工預寫保底，不回 `404` 空畫面（見 router.py\n的說明）。",
        "properties": {
          "narrative_text": {
            "title": "Narrative Text",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "narrative_text"
        ],
        "title": "DailyEventResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DialogueRequest": {
        "description": "對話請求（SDD 第8.5節）。\n\n`user_input` 的長度上限先用保守值。SDD 提到 `prompt_max_chars` 會依實測調整，\n但那要等真的接上 Gemini、看到成本數據之後才有依據。",
        "properties": {
          "user_input": {
            "maxLength": 500,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "User Input",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "user_input"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DialogueResponse": {
        "description": "對話回應（issue #42 可用版）。\n\n`tts` 為 `None` 時，路由層會用 `response_model_exclude_none=True` 把這個\n欄位整個從 JSON 拿掉，不會序列化成 `\"tts\": null`——TTS 合成失敗時是「這輪\n沒有語音」，不是「有一個空的語音物件」，兩者對客戶端的處理分支意義不同\n（同 B10 `tts.py` 模組說明）。安全邊界（B4）與完整 Prompt 組裝（B2）見\nissue #45。",
        "properties": {
          "reply_text": {
            "title": "Reply Text",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "source": {
            "title": "Source",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "tts": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/TTSResult"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "reply_text",
          "source"
        ],
        "title": "DialogueResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "description": "統一錯誤回應模型（issue #30）。\n\n形狀對齊 FastAPI `HTTPException` 既有的 `{\"detail\": ...}`——**不改變任何\n現有錯誤的實際 JSON 形狀**，只是讓契約描述它，讓 codegen 產出單一錯誤\nDTO。`detail` 用 `Any`：多數端點是字串，配額超限（429）是物件\n（`resource`／`limit`／`reset_at`），契約要能同時涵蓋兩種而不失真。",
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "title": "Detail"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "detail"
        ],
        "title": "ErrorResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "HTTPValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ValidationError"
            },
            "title": "Detail",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "HTTPValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "MemorySummaryItem": {
        "description": "`GET /players/me/memory-summary` 的單筆記憶（issue #37）。\n\n刻意不含 `embedding`——向量是內部實作，對玩家無意義，回應會因此暴增\n數十 KB（AC 明訂檢查）。",
        "properties": {
          "created_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "summary_text": {
            "title": "Summary Text",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "summary_text",
          "created_at"
        ],
        "title": "MemorySummaryItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "MemorySummaryResponse": {
        "description": "依 `spirit_id` 分組（issue #37 AC2）。",
        "properties": {
          "memories_by_spirit": {
            "additionalProperties": {
              "items": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MemorySummaryItem"
              },
              "type": "array"
            },
            "title": "Memories By Spirit",
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "memories_by_spirit"
        ],
        "title": "MemorySummaryResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "OrientationInfo": {
        "description": "SDD v2.1 §10.2：3DoF 定向用的靈魂方位設定（issue #30）。\n\n`bearing_deg`：相對召喚點的方位角，真北 0°、順時針。`height_offset_m`：\n垂直偏移。兩者包成巢狀物件（不是攤平兩個欄位），對齊 SDD 的回應範例，\n也讓客戶端能把「方位設定」整包傳給 `OrientationService`。",
        "properties": {
          "bearing_deg": {
            "title": "Bearing Deg",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "height_offset_m": {
            "title": "Height Offset M",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "bearing_deg",
          "height_offset_m"
        ],
        "title": "OrientationInfo",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerCreateRequest": {
        "description": "App 首次啟動時呼叫。device_id 由 App 產生並存在裝置安全儲存區\n（對應 CONTEXT.md「匿名玩家」定義），這裡不接受任何硬體裝置 ID 當替代。",
        "properties": {
          "device_id": {
            "maxLength": 128,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "device_id"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerCreateRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "PlayerResponse": {
        "description": "`POST /api/v1/players` 的回應。\n\n`account_id` 是對外契約，對應 DB 的 `auth_provider_id`（0003 改的名）。\nclient 的 `PlayerDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"account_id\")]` 寫死了這個 key。\n\n綁定流程做起來的時候，這裡應該一併把 `auth_provider` 也吐出去——\n只有「provider 那邊的 id」而不知道是哪一家 provider，資訊是不完整的。\n那一次改動要連 client 一起發版。",
        "properties": {
          "account_id": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Account Id"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Created At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "device_id": {
            "title": "Device Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "player_id": {
            "format": "uuid",
            "title": "Player Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "session_token": {
            "title": "Session Token",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "player_id",
          "device_id",
          "account_id",
          "created_at",
          "session_token"
        ],
        "title": "PlayerResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ProfileResonanceItem": {
        "properties": {
          "resonance_value": {
            "title": "Resonance Value",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "stage": {
            "title": "Stage",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "resonance_value",
          "stage"
        ],
        "title": "ProfileResonanceItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ProfileResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /profile`（issue #36，v2.1 §10.3 漏列，補回；SDD v1 §8.10）。\n\n純身體自己的表直查，不呼叫腦袋——`quests`／`resonance` 兩個陣列長度不必\n相同（玩家可能對某靈魂有共鳴但沒有任務進度列，反之亦然）。",
        "properties": {
          "quests": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestListItem"
            },
            "title": "Quests",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "resonance": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ProfileResonanceItem"
            },
            "title": "Resonance",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quests",
          "resonance"
        ],
        "title": "ProfileResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestCompleteRequest": {
        "description": "`POST /quests/{questId}/complete`（issue #34）。\n\n`completion_evidence` 刻意是不驗證內容的 dict：後端確定性規則判定完成\n與否是由呼叫端（客戶端的可驗證微任務邏輯）自己保證的前提，這裡不重新\n驗一次任務內容——CONTEXT.md「可驗證微任務」的定義是「以後端確定性規則\n驗證完成與否」，而完成條件本身屬於任務設計，不是這支端點的職責。",
        "properties": {
          "completion_evidence": {
            "title": "Completion Evidence",
            "type": "object"
          }
        },
        "title": "QuestCompleteRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestCompleteResponse": {
        "description": "issue #34（前半：確定性規則判定完成 ＋ 共鳴入帳）／#43（後半：接上敘事\n包裝與解鎖故事）。\n\n`unlock_stories` 是 **list**，不是單一 `unlock_story | null`——issue #34\n的原始回應範例只想到「跨一個門檻」的情況，但 #43 AC3 明訂一次入帳跨過\n多個門檻時每個 stage 都要各有一段故事（`resonance.ResonanceResult\n.newly_unlocked_stages` 本身也是 list，同一個理由：只取最後一個會讓\n中間那段靜默消失）。空 list 就是「沒跨門檻」，不需要另外一個\n`newly_unlocked_stages` 欄位重複同一件事——每個 `UnlockStory.stage`\n已經帶著這個資訊。",
        "properties": {
          "quest_wrapper_text": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Quest Wrapper Text"
          },
          "resonance_value": {
            "title": "Resonance Value",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "unlock_stories": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/UnlockStory"
            },
            "title": "Unlock Stories",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "resonance_value"
        ],
        "title": "QuestCompleteResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestListItem": {
        "description": "`GET /quests/daily` 的單筆任務（issue #33 SDD v1 §8.7）。\n\n`spirit_id` 不是資料庫欄位，是從 `quest_id` 反推的（見\n`quests.spirit_id_for_quest`）——`quest_progress` 表本身沒有這一欄。",
        "properties": {
          "attempts_today": {
            "title": "Attempts Today",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "quest_id": {
            "title": "Quest Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "in_progress",
              "completed",
              "daily_limit_reached"
            ],
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quest_id",
          "spirit_id",
          "status",
          "attempts_today"
        ],
        "title": "QuestListItem",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestListResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "quests": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestListItem"
            },
            "title": "Quests",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quests"
        ],
        "title": "QuestListResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "QuestStateResponse": {
        "description": "SDD 第8.4節的 `quest` 欄位。\n\n`status` 是 `Literal`（issue #30）而不是裸 `str`——OpenAPI 因此產出真正\n的 `enum`，Unity 端才有 enum 可解析（SDD v2.1 §11.2.1 硬規則5）。三個值\n的語意分界不變：`in_progress`／`completed` 是資料庫狀態，\n`daily_limit_reached` **只存在於 API 回應**，是查詢當下依 `attempts_date`\n算出來的結果（見 `quests.effective_state`），不落地。",
        "properties": {
          "attempts_today": {
            "title": "Attempts Today",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "quest_id": {
            "title": "Quest Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "status": {
            "enum": [
              "in_progress",
              "completed",
              "daily_limit_reached"
            ],
            "title": "Status",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "quest_id",
          "status",
          "attempts_today"
        ],
        "title": "QuestStateResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ResonanceQueryResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /resonance/{spiritId}`（issue #35 SDD v1 §8.9）。",
        "properties": {
          "next_threshold": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Next Threshold"
          },
          "resonance_value": {
            "title": "Resonance Value",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "stage": {
            "title": "Stage",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "resonance_value",
          "stage",
          "next_threshold"
        ],
        "title": "ResonanceQueryResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseRequest": {
        "description": "S2-new．感應範圍驗證請求（SDD 第8.3節）。\n\n刻意**不**收 `gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location`：那兩個欄位是給 S3 防作弊\n觀察期用的，而觀察期記錄的是「在場」——CONTEXT.md 對在場紀錄的定義是完成\n在場驗證所需的地標與時間，感應範圍不構成在場。150 公尺外的一次感應不該產生\n任何可用來推測玩家位置的紀錄。",
        "properties": {
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SenseRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SenseResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "sense_token": {
            "title": "Sense Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sense_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SenseResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SpiritResponse": {
        "description": "`GET /api/v1/spirits/{placeId}` 的回應。\n\n**欄位名是對外契約，跟資料庫欄位名脫鉤。** 0002 把 DB 欄位改成\n`spirit_id` / `display_name` / `*_radius_meters` 之後，這裡靠\n`validation_alias` 從 ORM 物件讀新名字，但輸出仍是舊的 JSON key——\nUnity client 的 `SpiritDto` 用 `[JsonProperty(\"place_id\")]` 寫死了那些\n名字，改動等於要發一版客戶端。\n\n改 DB 欄位名不需要動客戶端，這正是兩者脫鉤的用途；反過來說，**要改這裡的\n欄位名時，必須連同 client 一起改**。",
        "properties": {
          "is_active": {
            "title": "Is Active",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "name": {
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "orientation": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OrientationInfo"
          },
          "place_id": {
            "title": "Place Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "sense_radius_m": {
            "title": "Sense Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "summon_radius_m": {
            "title": "Summon Radius M",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "place_id",
          "name",
          "latitude",
          "longitude",
          "summon_radius_m",
          "sense_radius_m",
          "is_active",
          "orientation"
        ],
        "title": "SpiritResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonRequest": {
        "description": "S2．在場驗證請求（SDD 第8.4節）。\n\n`gps_accuracy_m` 與 `is_mock_location` 供 S3 防作弊觀察期使用\n（見 `anticheat.py`）：偵測到只記 log，不影響這次召喚的結果。",
        "properties": {
          "gps_accuracy_m": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Gps Accuracy M"
          },
          "is_mock_location": {
            "default": false,
            "title": "Is Mock Location",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "latitude": {
            "maximum": 90.0,
            "minimum": -90.0,
            "title": "Latitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "longitude": {
            "maximum": 180.0,
            "minimum": -180.0,
            "title": "Longitude",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "maxLength": 64,
            "minLength": 1,
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "spirit_id",
          "latitude",
          "longitude"
        ],
        "title": "SummonRequest",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "SummonResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "encounter_token": {
            "title": "Encounter Token",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "quest": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/QuestStateResponse"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "spirit_id": {
            "title": "Spirit Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "encounter_token",
          "spirit_id"
        ],
        "title": "SummonResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "TTSResult": {
        "description": "v2.1 §10.1：`DialogueResponse.tts` 的形狀，**只有** `audio_url`。用\npydantic model（不是 dataclass）是因為它會直接嵌進 API response 序列化\n出去，跟其他 response model 用同一種宣告方式。\n\n不含任何 viseme／phoneme 欄位是刻意的契約——見模組開頭說明；#30 的契約\n快照會固定住這個形狀，之後想加欄位要走那邊的流程，不是在這裡隨手加。",
        "properties": {
          "audio_url": {
            "title": "Audio Url",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "audio_url"
        ],
        "title": "TTSResult",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "UnlockStory": {
        "properties": {
          "stage": {
            "title": "Stage",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "story_text": {
            "title": "Story Text",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "stage",
          "story_text"
        ],
        "title": "UnlockStory",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ValidationError": {
        "properties": {
          "loc": {
            "items": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              ]
            },
            "title": "Location",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "msg": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": {
            "title": "Error Type",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "loc",
          "msg",
          "type"
        ],
        "title": "ValidationError",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
